                                                "sense_id": "3afa8dd9-07cd-3c8c-a272-e924d4afed00",
                                                "text": "For these sapeurs, the essential thing was to dress elegantly, with name-brand clothes made by famous designers if possible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98941346-e71f-447d-a829-b9c90a048fac",
                                                "sense_id": "3afa8dd9-07cd-3c8c-a272-e924d4afed00",
                                                "text": "Since the 1920s, the sapeurs of the Congo have been making sartorial statements on the streets of Brazzaville and Kinshasa."
